        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AN-D9, St. Charles Lever With Oval Floral Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe symmetrical shapes of the petals on Fusion Hardware's Oval Floral Lever is mirrored in the likewise uniform appearance of the St. Charles Lever making this leverset a perfect marriage of balance. A high quality solid brass product, it is backed by a lifetime warranty. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AN-D9 Oval Floral Rose and Bella Villa Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Old World Door Lever Fusion AN D9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "St. Charles Lever with Oval Floral Rose, Fusion AN-D9",
                "description": "Bella Villa Reed Lever with Oval Floral Round Rose Fusion AN-D9 - The symmetrical shapes of the petals on Fusion Hardware's Oval Floral Lever is mirrored in the likewise uniform appearance of the St. Charles Lever making this leverset a perfect marriage of balance. A high quality solid brass product, it is backed by a lifetime warranty. It is available in 4 finishes; and it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "FUS-AN-D9, Fusion AN-D9, fusion hardware AN St. Charles levers, Fusion hardware D9 st. charles roses, ornate door levers, Oval Floral rosettes, solid brass leversets, old world collections,  Fusion AN Saint Charles levers, fusion hardware st. charles collections, fusion hardware An bella villa levers, fusion St. Charles Lever with Oval Floral Roses,"
